{"id":"n61166-1-9","stage":1,"title":"느낌 · 感觉","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61166-1-9-1","ko":"어디가 아파서 병원에 왔죠?","zh":"您是哪里不舒服才来医院的呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어디가","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아파서","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"병원에","meaning":"医院","explanation":"병원：医院；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62271","senseId":"1","lemma":"병원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔죠?","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"4f4c2d79c47ca512","term":"병원","zh":"医院","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3","entryId":"62271","definition":"具备相关设施、由医生和护士治疗病人的地方。","pronunciation":["병ː원"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/64a3adb2b299dd97ec60.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61166-1-9-2","ko":"계속 머리가 아프고 몸이 뻣뻣한 느낌이 있어서요.","zh":"因为一直头疼，而且身体感觉很僵硬。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"머리가","meaning":"头","explanation":"머리：头；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"머리","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66234","senseId":"1","lemma":"머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아프고","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몸이","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뻣뻣한","meaning":"僵硬，坚硬","explanation":"뻣뻣하다：僵硬，坚硬；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"뻣뻣하다","audio":"/audio/9ca59638c1135447a433.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61956","senseId":"1","lemma":"뻣뻣하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"느낌이","meaning":"感觉，感受","explanation":"느낌：感觉，感受；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"느낌","audio":"/audio/f376240a37fbad9834c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61166","senseId":"1","lemma":"느낌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어서요.","meaning":"处于，处在","explanation":"있다：处于，处在；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68796","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"23a9f0224cc40ec0","term":"계속","zh":"继续，持续","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3","entryId":"17692","definition":"连续不间断。","pronunciation":["계ː속","게ː속"]},{"id":"74eee3ddf202a62b","term":"머리","zh":"头","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3","entryId":"66234","definition":"在人或动物身体中，包括脸和头发的脖子以上的部分。","pronunciation":["머리"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"9ca59638c1135447","term":"뻣뻣하다","zh":"僵硬，坚硬","audio":"/audio/9ca59638c1135447a433.mp3","entryId":"61956","definition":"某种物体不柔软，坚固而硬。","pronunciation":["뻗뻐타다"]},{"id":"f376240a37fbad98","term":"느낌","zh":"感觉，感受","audio":"/audio/f376240a37fbad9834c5.mp3","entryId":"61166","definition":"身体或内心产生的情绪或情感。","pronunciation":["느낌"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"处于，处在","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68796","definition":"人或动物继续保持某种状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/36ff528dc28cf65be808.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.01,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61166","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":56,"sequenceScore":2.4607,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["您是哪里不舒服才来医院的呢？","因为一直头疼，而且身体感觉很僵硬。","啊！从昨天开始怎么突然脚踝这么疼啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["您是哪里不舒服才来医院的呢？","因为一直头疼，而且身体感觉很僵硬。","啊！从昨天开始怎么突然脚踝这么疼啊？"],"answer":1}]}
